# Copy to .env.local and fill in to use the AI judge. Without these, the app
# falls back to a lenient local rule-based judge (fine for UI work).
#
# Both values are public (they ship in the app); row level security protects
# the data. Find them under Project Settings -> API keys. For a local stack
# (`npx supabase start`), use http://127.0.0.1:54321 and the publishable key it prints.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
